            <div xml:id="d511">

                <pb facs="0720" n="706" sameAs="frus:frus1944v06/pg706"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/11–2144: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Atcheson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-11-21">November 21,
                        1944</date>.<lb/>[Received 9:06 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1881. Announced in press that following new appointments made in party and
                    Government, T. V. Soong and Chou Chung-yueh, State Councillors; Chou Chung-yueh,
                    Vice President of Examination Yuan; Chen Li-fu, Minister of Organization; Wang
                    Shih-chieh, Minister of Information; Liang Han-tsao, Minister of Overseas
                    Affairs; Chang Li-sheng, Minister of Interior; General Chen Cheng, Minister of
                    War; O. K. Yui, Minister of Finance; Chu Chia-hua, Minister of Education.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Atcheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
